      players: 'Minimum Players: 4\nMaximum Players: 4\nOptimal Players: 4\nPartnerships: None; each player plays for themselves against the banker.',
      deck: 'Type: Double-six style domino set (28 tiles)\nNumber of Sets: 1\nJokers: Not used; tiles are standard dominoes with pip values from 0 to 6.',
      equipment: 'One domino tile set, stakes or chips for betting, and table space to lay out the Stamm and tableau.',
      dealing: 'Tiles per Player: 6 in the basic form, or 7 in the common variation; remaining tiles form the three-column Stamm or a single row used to mark betting positions.\nDealing Pattern: Clockwise; banker lays out the Stamm after players draw their tiles.',
